# S10 (#1179, D-RA-052), for the integration build's window
# (fix-walk-pending-image): HARDCORE MODE while offline achievements are on.
# 1. Offline achievements on (OFFLINE ACHIEVEMENTS (BETA)), back to
#    RETROACHIEVEMENTS SETTINGS. Frame at 640x480, EN and FR: HARDCORE MODE
#    dimmed, its line "Can't change while OFFLINE ACHIEVEMENTS (BETA) is on." /
#    "Non modifiable tant que SUCCES HORS LIGNE (BETA) est active." on one line.
# 2. Press OK on HARDCORE MODE: the switch stays as it was; close the page;
#    get_setting global.retroachievements.hardcore unchanged.
# 3. Turn offline achievements off from the page below, without leaving the
#    parent: the row undims and shows the hardcore value the ctl restored; a
#    press now changes it.
# 4. A device holding both keys on (set by hand on the guest): the row shows
#    ON, dimmed; nothing on the page rewrites either key.
